Package: Rsimcity
Type: Package
Title: R6 Suite for Simulations
Version: 0.2.8
Author: Marcello Gallucci [aut, cre]
Authors@R: person("Marcello", "Gallucci", email = "mcfanda@gmail.com",
        role = c("aut", "cre"))
Maintainer: Marcello Gallucci <mcfanda@gmail.com>
Description: Tools for defining and running simulation experiments. Provides
        an R6-based workflow for specifying fixed parameters, experimental
        design conditions, simulation steps, and result aggregation. Includes
        functions for generating samples with specified correlations or
        explained variance, and utilities for summarizing and plotting results.
Imports: ggplot2, statmod, digest, gtable
Suggests: R6, later, shiny, future, future.apply, progress, testthat (>= 3.0.0), knitr, rmarkdown
Config/testthat/edition: 3
